WEBVTT

00:05:59.817 --> 00:06:02.000
and release them
into the clean waters there

00:06:02.024 --> 00:06:03.453
and let them swim back home?"

00:06:04.056 --> 00:06:06.066
(Laughter)

00:06:08.145 --> 00:06:11.463
So three of those penguins --
Peter, Pamela and Percy --

00:06:11.487 --> 00:06:12.638
wore satellite tags,

00:06:12.662 --> 00:06:14.641
and the researchers crossed their fingers

00:06:14.665 --> 00:06:16.906
and hoped that by the time
they got back home,

00:06:16.930 --> 00:06:19.155
the oil would be cleaned up
from their islands.

00:06:19.179 --> 00:06:22.100
And luckily, the day they arrived, it was.

00:06:22.124 --> 00:06:26.043
So it had been a huge gamble,
but it had paid off.

00:06:26.067 --> 00:06:28.977
And so they know now
that they can use this strategy

00:06:29.001 --> 00:06:30.485
in future oil spills.